Note on game assets
-------------------

This licence covers the tooling and the translation memory in this repository.
It does not cover anything owned by Playsport Games or SEGA:

* The repository deliberately contains no game data. The files under `extract/`,
  `assets/`, `build/` and `dist/` are generated locally from a legitimately
  installed copy of the game by `tools/extract.py` and are not distributed here.
* `trans/zh_cache.jsonl` maps original English strings to their Chinese
  translations. It is published so that the translation can be reviewed,
  corrected and reproduced. If you are a rights holder and want it removed,
  open an issue and it will be taken down.

The CJK glyphs baked into the font atlases are derived from Noto Sans SC,
which is licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.

《Motorsport Manager》 and all related assets are © Playsport Games / SEGA.
